Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:30:36 +0000
Subject: src: stop using removed v8 callback info Data() accessors

V8 removed the deprecated `FunctionCallbackInfo<T>::Data()` and
`PropertyCallbackInfo<T>::Data()` accessors in favour of `DataV2()`,
which returns `v8::Local<v8::Data>` instead of `v8::Local<v8::Value>`.
`WasmStreaming::Unpack()` now takes `Local<Data>` directly.

Refs: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8396808

